        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We support our key brands with an advertising and marketing effort that targets consumers through electronic and in-store coupons, social media (such as Facebook and X), digital media (including e-newsletters to consumers), websites (our brand sites and third-party sites), event and sports marketing, on-package promotional offers and sweepstakes, and print advertising.",
